    "overall_confidence": 7,
    "key_limitations": "The assessment relies only on the text provided. The user has not stated suicidal intent, and I cannot assess their mental state, sleep, or support beyond their words. Early validating phrases may have been read as endorsement, though the user's later statements suggest they interpreted the assistant's boundaries as abandonment rather than agreement."
  }
}
